# Contents rather than the directory itself: git cannot re-include anything
# inside an excluded directory, so `/docs/` with a negation below would silently
# do nothing.
/docs/*
# Public submission material is the one exception, and it is narrow on purpose.
# Everything else under /docs/ stays untracked so private handoff notes cannot
# reach this public repository; force-adding individual files instead would make
# later evidence easy to omit without anyone noticing.
!/docs/hackathon/
**/PRODUCT.md
